flowchart LR
  Desktop[Electron desktop] -->|starts or resolves| CLI[Local CLI server]
  UI[Vue UI] -->|WebSocket requests| CLI
  UI -->|native operations via preload IPC| Desktop
  CLI --> Core[core-node]
  Core --> Graph[Pipeline graph executor]
  Core --> Plan[Release planner and compiler]
  Plan --> Runtime[Workflow runtime]
  Runtime --> Plugins[Registered plugin tasks]
